# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# These same variables must ALSO be set in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard
# (Settings -> Environment variables), for Production and Preview. A value that
# only exists locally will be missing from the deployed site.

# --- Contact form -----------------------------------------------------------
# Get this at https://web3forms.com — enter sixstacksolutions@gmail.com and the
# key is emailed to you. Free, unlimited, no account needed.
#
# This one is PUBLIC on purpose. Web3Forms keys are designed to sit in client
# code: a key can only ever deliver mail to the address it was issued for, so
# exposure means someone could send us email, nothing worse. That is why it is
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ and why it appears in the JavaScript bundle.
#
# Set as: plaintext (not a secret) in Cloudflare.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# --- Chatbot ----------------------------------------------------------------
# The chatbot's API key is NOT set here. It is read by the Cloudflare Pages
# Function at functions/api/chat.ts and must be added in the Cloudflare
# dashboard as an ENCRYPTED SECRET named ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
#
# It must never be NEXT_PUBLIC_ and must never appear in this file's committed
# form: this site ships as static files, so anything the frontend can read is
# readable by anyone who opens devtools, and a leaked key is billed to us.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
#
# Optional override, plaintext, e.g. claude-haiku-4-5 for a cheaper bot:
# CHAT_MODEL=
